IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cgsa-carriage`

-- Carriage of Goods by Sea Act 1972, ss 3-5 and Articles I, III-VII and X of the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_carriage-of-goods-by-sea-act-1972.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`an export from Singapore under a bill` MEANS Shipment WITH
    `document` IS `a bill of lading`
    `cargo` IS `general cargo`
    `shipped from a port in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `between ports in 2 different States` IS TRUE
    `bill issued in a contracting State` IS FALSE
    `shipped from a port in a contracting State` IS FALSE
    `the contract expressly provides that the Rules govern` IS FALSE

`a domestic voyage from Singapore under a bill` MEANS Shipment WITH
    `document` IS `a bill of lading`
    `cargo` IS `general cargo`
    `shipped from a port in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `between ports in 2 different States` IS FALSE
    `bill issued in a contracting State` IS FALSE
    `shipped from a port in a contracting State` IS FALSE
    `the contract expressly provides that the Rules govern` IS FALSE

`a bill between two non-contracting States` MEANS Shipment WITH
