#ASSERT `what the stated weight proves against the carrier` `a bill of lading` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `prima facie evidence`
#ASSERT `what the stated weight proves against the carrier` `a bill of lading` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `conclusive evidence`
#ASSERT `what the stated weight proves against the carrier` `a bill of lading` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no presumption`
