§ `Articles III(8), V, VI, VII`

#ASSERT `it is a valid Article VI special agreement` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `it is a valid Article VI special agreement` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `the clause is effective` `excluding liability for negligent care of the cargo` TRUE FALSE
